  "id": "blackened-red-snapper",
  "name": "Blackened Red Snapper",
  "subtitle": "Spiced snapper fillets cooked in butter",
  "description": "Red snapper fillets are coated with a bold dried-spice blend, dipped in melted butter, and skillet-cooked until opaque and flaky.",
